s://github.com/ud-tetra/UD/tree/9d5f9f354d36b8528fa20c86d7837d18d0edee1f/captures/2026-10-17T140202Z-codex-restricted-fault-history-e21f46fc">Versioned evidence ↗</a></td></tr><tr><td>19 · Optimize restricted validation precision and measurement-count frontier</td><td>Later research capture</td><td><a class="text-link" href="/sources/observation-v0.1/validation-tradeoff-da0fdb89-UD_VALIDATION_PRECISION_WORK_FRONTIER_v0.1.md">Read report</a> · <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/ud-tetra/UD/tree/9d5f9f354d36b8528fa20c86d7837d18d0edee1f/captures/2026-10-17T142835Z-codex-validation-tradeoff-da0fdb89">Versioned evidence ↗</a></td></tr><tr><td>20 · Derive finite-sample noise versus retained-signal frontier</td><td>Later research capture</td><td><a class="text-link" href="/sources/observation-v0.1/noise-retention-1824b625-UD_NOISE_RETENTION_FRONTIER_v0.1.md">Read report</a> · <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/ud-tetra/UD/tree/9d5f9f354d36b8528fa20c86d7837d18d0edee1f/captures/2026-10-17T144006Z-codex-noise-retention-1824b625">Versioned evidence ↗</a></td></tr><tr><td>21 · Freeze conditional primary acquisition and review contract</td><td>Later research capture</td><td><a class="text-link" href="/sources/observation-v0.1/acquisition-freeze-ceda2dba-UD_FROZEN_ACQUISITION_CONTRACT_v0.1.md">Read report</a> · <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/ud-tetra/UD/tree/9d5f9f354d36b8528fa20c86d7837d18d0edee1f/captures/2026-10-17T145236Z-codex-acquisition-freeze-ceda2dba">Versioned evidence ↗</a></td></tr><tr><td>22 · Certify storage-limited Hankel spectra and audit parallel monitoring claims</td><td>Later research capture</td><td><a class="text-link" href="/sources/observation-v0.1/spectral-extraction-3ffbbcbf-UD_STORAGE_LIMITED_SPECTRAL_EXTRACTION_v0.1.md">Read report</a> · <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/ud-tetra/UD/tree/9d5f9f354d36b8528fa20c86d7837d18d0edee1f/captures/2026-10-17T152126Z-codex-spectral-extraction-3ffbbcbf">Versioned evidence ↗</a></td></tr><tr><td>23 · Benchmark frozen nominal Hankel pipeline with verified factor Grams</td><td>Later research capture</td><td><a class="text-link" href="/sources/observation-v0.1/nominal-benchmark-b80f21bf-README.md">Read report</a> · <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/ud-tetra/UD/tree/9d5f9f354d36b8528fa20c86d7837d18d0edee1f/captures/2026-10-17T165137Z-codex-nominal-benchmark-b80f21bf">Versioned evidence ↗</a></td></tr><tr><td>24 · Certify record-only Hankel extraction and full-size perturbation controls</td><td>Later research capture</td><td><a class="text-link" href="/sources/observation-v0.1/record-only-spectrum-fc6e3b97-RECORD_ONLY_THEOREMS.md">Read report</a> · <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/ud-tetra/UD/tree/9d5f9f354d36b8528fa20c86d7837d18d0edee1f/captures/2026-10-17T173305Z-codex-record-only-spectrum-fc6e3b97">Versioned evidence ↗</a></td></tr><tr><td>25 · Certify noisy record proposals and prepare independent review packet</td><td>Later research capture</td><td><a class="text-link" href="/sources/observation-v0.1/noisy-proposal-6371dfe9-README.md">Read report</a> · <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/ud-tetra/UD/tree/9d5f9f354d36b8528fa20c86d7837d18d0edee1f/captures/2026-10-17T181003Z-codex-noisy-proposal-6371dfe9">Versioned evidence ↗</a></td></tr><tr><td>26 · Audit supplied review attestations and hold unbound review claims</td><td>Later research capture</td><td><a class="text-link" href="/sources/observation-v0.1/review-intake-b8630c6a-AUDIT_REPORT.md">Read report</a> · <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/ud-tetra/UD/tree/9d5f9f354d36b8528fa20c86d7837d18d0edee1f/captures/2026-10-17T182704Z-codex-review-intake-b8630c6a">Versioned evidence ↗</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="actions"><a class="text-link" href="/sources/observation-v0.1/SESSION_SOURCE_MAP.json">Machine-readable source map ↓</a><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/ud-tetra/UD/blob/9d5f9f354d36b8528fa20c86d7837d18d0edee1f/captures/2026-10-17T184000Z-codex-session-publication-7f4a2d91/README.md">Full repository index ↗</a></div><p>Public reports are copied byte-for-byte and hash-bound. Code and datasets remain in the linked immutable repository evidence. The unavailable Genesis PNG and earlier excluded private source text are not republished. This is an accessible artifact record, not an export of hidden model state or a complete chat transcript.</p></div></section></main><footer><div><a href="/">Unified Dynamics</a><p>Benjamin Walker Mayes · Independent researcher<br>AI-assisted research · Public reading edition 0.14</p></div><div><a href="/sources/">Sources & coverage</a><a href="/contribution/">Contribution</a><a href="https://tetrahedral-packet-complexes.ben-w-mayes.chatgpt.site/">Living research portal ↗</a></div><p class="footer-rule">Proof, simulation and physical correspondence retain distinct evidence status. Physical promotion: 0.</p></footer></div></body></html>
