 <section class="chapter"><div class="chapter-label">01</div><div><h2>Coherent histories through the window</h2><p>At intermediate time the clock is a superposition of prefix addresses. Each address carries its complete work, state history and donor/receipt prefix. Selecting a prefix below inspects that branch; it does not model a measurement.</p><div class="search-tools"><label>Response branch<select id="pc-branch"><option>C</option><option>H</option></select></label><label>Ticks per episode<select id="pc-ticks"><option>1</option><option>2</option><option selected>4</option><option>8</option></select></label><label>Reset donors<select id="pc-resets"><option>0</option><option selected>1</option><option>2</option><option>3</option></select></label></div><label class="jc-window-label"><input type="checkbox" id="pc-pad" checked> Append an identity gate when the word length is odd</label>
