+family. H is a chain-space metric; no spacetime-metric identity is asserted.
+
+For an observed row r, define
+
+\[
+J^K_r=\bigcup_{u\in P_r\cup\{r\}}\operatorname{supp}(A[u,:]),
+\qquad J^C_r=J^K_r\cup P_r\cup\{r\}.
+\]
